{% comment %}
  Extended Warranty nested cart sync (app embed)

  Enable this embed in the theme editor so warranty children stay attached
  to the correct parent cart line when quantity changes happen on the cart
  page or in a cart drawer, not only on the PDP.

  Shopify nested cart lines already remove a warranty when its parent
  product line is removed. This script additionally:
  - keeps warranty quantity in sync with the parent line
  - removes the lowest-priced warranty first when a parent quantity drops
  - never moves a warranty from one parent product onto another
{% endcomment %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "EW nested cart",
  "target": "body",
  "javascript": "pdp-extended-warranty.js",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
